; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR RACE CONDITION  -  VM2: the second worker   (web copy based at $4000: the Multitasking page moves program 2 to $5000 itself)
; ==========================================================================
; Load BOTH programs - Race-VM1.lst at $4000 and Race-VM2.lst at $5000 - then
; cold-boot. VM1 and VM2 each add 1 to a shared counter 500 times (READ it, ADD
; one, WRITE it back). Round 1 has no lock and loses updates when the scheduler
; switches VMs between a read and its write; round 2 wraps the three opcodes in
; $C7 SETMULTI 00 / 01 and gets exactly 1000. VM1 prints the scores.
;
; The counter is in VM1's memory (relative $0F00); VM1 opens it with $D0 SHAREVM
; read/write, and VM2 uses the cross-VM copies $D4 COPYVMXY / $D5 COPYXVMY.
; GO ($0F02) and DONE ($0F04) words coordinate the rounds; Race-VM1.lst clears
; them in its D-lines so leftovers from an earlier run cannot start a round early.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/race_verify.py, V0061.33, two-VM cold boot): round 1 loses 196 of 1000 (got 804), round 2 gets exactly 1000; the loss is deterministic (opcode-count scheduler), so the Elf2K should show the same 196.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 48 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 5000 CD             START
; D 5001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 5005 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; W1:
; D 5009 D4 10 34       COPYVMXY VM1 M(R3) -> R4           VM1's GO word
; D 500C 86 04 00 01    TESTXI R4 0001
; D 5010 A1 00 09       IFFALSEI W1                        Wait for round 1
; D 5013 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 5017 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 501B 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L1:
; D 501F D4 10 AB       COPYVMXY VM1 M(RA) -> RB           READ the counter (from VM1)
; D 5022 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 5024 D5 10 BA       COPYXVMY RB -> VM1 M(RA)           WRITE it back (to VM1)
; D 5027 43 06          DECX R6
; D 5029 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 502B A1 00 34       IFFALSEI N1
; D 502E CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 5030 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N1:
; D 5034 43 05          DECX R5
; D 5036 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 5038 A1 00 1F       IFFALSEI L1
; D 503B 11 03 0F 04    LOADXI R3 0F04
; D 503F 11 04 00 01    LOADXI R4 0001
; D 5043 D5 10 43       COPYXVMY R4 -> VM1 M(R3)           DONE round 1
; D 5046 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; W2:
; D 504A D4 10 34       COPYVMXY VM1 M(R3) -> R4
; D 504D 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002
; D 5051 A1 00 4A       IFFALSEI W2                        Wait for round 2
; D 5054 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 5058 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 505C 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L2:
; D 5060 C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Lock: no switching from here ...
; D 5062 D4 10 AB       COPYVMXY VM1 M(RA) -> RB           READ the counter (from VM1)
; D 5065 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 5067 D5 10 BA       COPYXVMY RB -> VM1 M(RA)           WRITE it back (to VM1)
; D 506A C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        ... to here
; D 506C 43 06          DECX R6
; D 506E 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 5070 A1 00 79       IFFALSEI N2
; D 5073 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 5075 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N2:
; D 5079 43 05          DECX R5
; D 507B 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 507D A1 00 60       IFFALSEI L2
; D 5080 11 03 0F 04    LOADXI R3 0F04
; D 5084 11 04 00 02    LOADXI R4 0002
; D 5088 D5 10 43       COPYXVMY R4 -> VM1 M(R3)           DONE round 2
; D 508B 00             HALT                               VM2 finished
; D 508C F0 00 00       BREAK                              End marker

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; CODE  -  download this block
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

D 4000 CD
D 4001 11 0F 00 0A
D 4005 11 03 0F 02
D 4009 D4 10 34
D 400C 86 04 00 01
D 4010 A1 00 09
D 4013 11 05 01 F4
D 4017 11 06 00 32
D 401B 11 0A 0F 00
D 401F D4 10 AB
D 4022 42 0B
D 4024 D5 10 BA
D 4027 43 06
D 4029 8C 06
D 402B A1 00 34
D 402E CA 32
D 4030 11 06 00 32
D 4034 43 05
D 4036 8C 05
D 4038 A1 00 1F
D 403B 11 03 0F 04
D 403F 11 04 00 01
D 4043 D5 10 43
D 4046 11 03 0F 02
D 404A D4 10 34
D 404D 86 04 00 02
D 4051 A1 00 4A
D 4054 11 05 01 F4
D 4058 11 06 00 32
D 405C 11 0A 0F 00
D 4060 C7 00
D 4062 D4 10 AB
D 4065 42 0B
D 4067 D5 10 BA
D 406A C7 01
D 406C 43 06
D 406E 8C 06
D 4070 A1 00 79
D 4073 CA 32
D 4075 11 06 00 32
D 4079 43 05
D 407B 8C 05
D 407D A1 00 60
D 4080 11 03 0F 04
D 4084 11 04 00 02
D 4088 D5 10 43
D 408B 00
D 408C F0 00 00
